Here’s the HTTP request you’d send to VirusTotal to submit the vote:

```
POST https://www.virustotal.com/api/v3/ip_addresses/22.242.75.136/votes
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer key_four

{
  "type": "vote",
  "attributes": {
    "verdict": "malicious"
  }
}
```

Replace `key_four` with your actual API key if it isn’t already. This will register the IP address `22.242.75.136` as malicious in VirusTotal.
